- config.rs, debug.rs, tests.rs, mod.rs
- graph/ — code graph builder, node, edge, project_graph
- index/ — BM25 index + chunk indexing, vector store, lookup
- parser/ — tree-sitter scanner, syn extractor
- retrieval/ — hybrid search, graph expansion, reranker

